{
  "$comment": "Single source of truth for effect-param names/symbols/ranges across the web app, packages/core's DSP wrappers, and the WASM AudioWorkletProcessors (issue #51). Generated C++ .inc fragments and the JS index-map module are produced from this file by scripts/gen-param-schema.mjs - never hand-edit the generated output. Canonical symbol casing is snake_case, matching packages/core's existing GetParamInfo() tables (those were kept as-is; the web side was renamed to match - see issue #41). Scope: only the 10 effect kinds with real DSP backing in packages/core today, plus the 3 real params (input_level/output_level/slim_size) shared by the 5 NAM-model block kinds (amp/amp-cab/pedal/outboard/space). The amp tone stack (bass/mid/treble/presence), cab's irMix, and mixer/splitter have no packages/core DSP behind them yet and are intentionally NOT in this schema - see issue #51's discussion.",
